ferentiate the velocity $v(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}\\,(\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}-6t+6) \\\\  & ={t}^{2}+t-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the mass is always positive, the force has zero magnitude when the acceleration equals zero. So, we set $a(t)=0$ and solve for $t:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}^{2}+t-6 & =0 \\\\ (t-2)(t+3) & =0 \\\\ t & =-3,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $t\\ge 0,$ we disregard the negative solution. \n\nTherefore, the force has zero magnitude at ${t}_{∗}=2\\,\\text{s}.$" 13194139535887 true] [17592186372690 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372691 13194139535887 true] [17592186372690 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535887 true] [17592186372690 1041 "field-1" 13194139535887 true] [17592186372690 1104 #edb/ref 17592186372691 13194139535887 true] [17592186372690 1110 #uuid "6e63334d-e5db-5e4a-99c3-8002e96bb33c" 13194139535887 true] [17592186372691 1034 "2" 13194139535887 true] [17592186372691 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535887 true] [17592186372691 1111 #uuid "7129fe52-04fa-55b0-88be-0ec0c69995ba" 13194139535887 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-138889" 17592186372650 "q-138889/selection" 17592186372651 "q-138889/selection/0288fd2da33bf8942d1b5feb1dba9b8a6744a53d92a9a45330cef8cc5baca740" 17592186372652 "q-138889/selection/85732c6d8b20455b883784c01b47cde501586949dfbdafdd65e2637fc9294ebf" 17592186372653 "q-138889/selection/c7df3d30f90a7df668325ad06d6f681edfaf4ac22f83ec79f44f5240231be1e4" 17592186372654 "q-138889/selection/cc711e6f789fbc6775f97cfdf12568624da2841f5947b4aa7ab64b7331fa39fc" 17592186372655 "q-138889/selection/ed2bea73019d750a65b2194297cd47b5b468796305ce4f17ef66f281924f0306" 17592186372656 "q-138900" 17592186372657 "q-138900/selection" 17592186372658 "q-138900/selection/0e60425cd3a5ff39671f252f602bfefa18c9c7a468398112ec2fa0ffa1233932" 17592186372659 "q-138900/selection/3a4cb68b6e2420440de2a5cf842cef8eda752c3a9743289f13ed7cf2875628e2" 17592186372660 "q-138900/se